sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Producer
    participant B as gRPC Broker
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant I as Inventory
    participant A as Audit

    P->>B: CreateTopic(orders.v1) [unary]
    B->>DB: create topic
    B-->>P: TopicReply

    I->>B: Subscribe(inventory, orders.v1) [server-streaming]
    A->>B: Subscribe(audit, orders.v1) [server-streaming]
    B->>DB: activate subscriptions

    P->>B: Publish(message) [unary]
    B->>DB: persist message + delivery per active consumer
    DB-->>B: commit
    B-->>P: PublishReply accepted=true

    Note over P,B: Publish confirmat inseamna persistat la broker,<br/>nu procesat de consumatori

    B-->>I: Delivery attempt=1
    B-->>A: Delivery attempt=1

    I->>B: ACK RECEIVED
    I->>I: local effect + dedup in transaction
    I->>B: ACK PROCESSED
    I->>B: ACK PERSISTED

    A->>B: ACK RECEIVED
    A->>A: audit + dedup
    A->>B: ACK PROCESSED
    A->>B: ACK PERSISTED

    B->>DB: mark deliveries COMPLETED